    <stages><li><label>又一个心智归入群脑</label><description>群脑又壮大了一分。</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="LP_IdeoSituationalBase">
    <defName>LP_Thought_Brain_ElderBrain</defName>
    <stages><li><label>上古脑的庇护</label><description>殖民地有一颗上古脑在低语。</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

